@ai-galaxy/dsh-sound README · Separate subagent channel：The settings panel adds a **子代理事件 / Subagent Events** section with six rows (same sound
sources and per-row volume as the main events) plus an **ignore all subagent events** master
switch. All six subagent sounds default to **mute**; main-agent events are unchanged.

@ai-galaxy/dsh-sound README · Install：Requires a DSH version with bundle-plugin support (`dsh.profile.bundles` + `dsh.bundle.patch`)
and `pnpm` on PATH (`corepack enable` or `npm i -g pnpm`).

```sh

@ai-galaxy/dsh-sound README · Publish：Published as `@ai-galaxy/dsh-sound` (requires membership of the `ai-galaxy` npm org;
`publishConfig.access` is already `public`).

```sh
npm login                       # npm account (2FA recommended)
npm publish --access public
```
